---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import '../styles/testimonials.css';

const floatingTestimonials = [
  'A lot of things we spoke about... suddenly, it all seems so clear.',
  'Emily has an intuitive sense for how energy moves through the body.',
  "I feel an internal softness, spaciousness, and care that I didn't have before.",
  "I've never felt this connected to myself or understood myself as deeply as I do now.",
  "I've tried other therapists, but none have been as insightful or as helpful as the experience I had working with Emily.",
  'Working with Emily is like being in a warm bath. She has such a welcoming presence, it really feels like I could never do or say the wrong thing.'
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Testimonials">
  <div class="testimonials-page page-shell">
    <main>
      <div class="page-header">
        <h1>Testimonials</h1>
        <p>Reflections from the journey</p>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonials-landscape">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509316785289-025f5b846b35?w=800&q=80" alt="" class="embedded-image image-1" />
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547036967-23d11aacaee0?w=800&q=80" alt="" class="embedded-image image-2" />
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1682687220742-aba13b6e50ba?w=800&q=80" alt="" class="embedded-image image-3" />
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518709268805-4e9042af9f23?w=800&q=80" alt="" class="embedded-image image-4" />

        <svg class="desert-element cactus-1" viewBox="0 0 100 150" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M 50 140 L 50 60 M 35 80 L 35 100 L 50 100 M 50 90 L 65 90 L 65 70" stroke="#D4663E" stroke-width="8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <svg class="desert-element sun-1" viewBox="0 0 100 100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="30" stroke="#A84632" stroke-width="3" fill="none"/><line x1="50" y1="10" x2="50" y2="20" stroke="#A84632" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="50" y1="80" x2="50" y2="90" stroke="#A84632" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="10" y1="50" x2="20" y2="50" stroke="#A84632" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="80" y1="50" x2="90" y2="50" stroke="#A84632" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
        <svg class="desert-element mountain-1" viewBox="0 0 150 80" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M 0 80 L 50 20 L 100 60 L 150 80" stroke="#D4663E" stroke-width="3" fill="none"/></svg>

        {floatingTestimonials.map((item, index) => (
          <div class={`testimonial-cloud cloud-${index + 1}`}>{item}</div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <section class="themed-testimonials">
        <div class="themed-container">
          <h2>What Shifts</h2>
          <p class="themed-intro">The specifics vary, but the themes are clear: relief, clarity, and a return to self.</p>

          <div class="theme-group">
            <h3>I finally feel calm and clear.</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>The anxiety I used to live with daily - it's just not running the show anymore.</li>
              <li>I stopped blaming myself for the assault. I feel peace in my body again.</li>
              <li>I love myself now. I've never been able to say that before.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="theme-group">
            <h3>My relationship changed - or I left, and I'm okay.</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>We were on the brink of divorce. Now we're connected again.</li>
              <li>I finally left the relationship that was draining me. I feel at home in myself.</li>
              <li>We weren't even fighting anymore, just numb. Now we're exploring desire again.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="theme-group">
            <h3>I understand what was driving me.</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>No one could get through to this stuck place - but this work did.</li>
              <li>I saw how old trauma with my dad was playing out with every man I dated.</li>
              <li>I can name it now - and because I can name it, it doesn't run me.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="heart-section">
        <h2>The Heart of This Work</h2>
        <p class="heart-copy">
          The real gift of this work isn't just the outcomes, it's how it feels to come home to yourself.
          Clients often arrive carrying pain, confusion, or disconnection, and leave feeling clear, rooted,
          self-loving, and alive. Whether it's a major life decision or a tender shift in how they relate to
          themselves, what emerges is always deeply human, deeply earned, and deeply theirs. <em>Clients report feeling...</em>
        </p>

        <ul class="feeling-list">
          <li>🌿 More connected to themselves</li>
          <li>🌿 More self-loving and present</li>
          <li>🌿 No longer afraid of their emotions</li>
          <li>🌿 Seeing old wounds with fresh perspective</li>
          <li>🌿 Letting go of self-blame and old narratives</li>
          <li>🌿 Able to stay with themselves through hard things</li>
          <li>🌿 Feeling lovable, safe, and seen</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="client-quote">
          <blockquote>"I can jump higher because my feet are more firmly planted on the ground."</blockquote>
          <p>Past Client</p>
        </div>

        <div class="client-quote">
          <blockquote>"I felt so seen by you, it made it easier to see myself."</blockquote>
          <p>Past Client</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cta-strip">
        <p>Ready to start your journey?</p>
        <a href={site.calendlyUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="cta-button">Schedule a Consult</a>
      </section>

      <div class="featured-quote-section">
        <p class="featured-quote">"And the time came when the risk to remain tight in a bud was more painful than the risk it took to blossom"</p>
        <p class="quote-author">Anais Nin</p>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
